(edge_transport__grid_ggd, :path) => Info(String[], "-", "STR_0D", "Path of the grid, including the IDS name, in case of implicit reference to a grid_ggd node described in another IDS. To be filled only if the grid is not described explicitly in this grid_ggd structure. Example syntax: IDS::wall/0/description_ggd(1)/grid_ggd, means that the grid is located in the wall IDS, occurrence 0, with relative path description_ggd(1)/grid_ggd, using Fortran index convention (here : first index of the array)", false, String[]),
