(mhd__grid_ggd___space___geometry_type, :name) => Info(String[], "-", "STR_0D", "Short string identifier", false, String[]),
(mhd__grid_ggd___space, :identifier) => Info(String[], "-", "STRUCTURE", "Space identifier\n0) unspecified : unspecified\n1) primary_standard : Primary space defining the standard grid\n2) primary_staggered : Primary space defining a grid staggered with respect to the primary standard space\n3) secondary_structured : Secondary space defining additional dimensions that extend the primary standard space in a structured way", false, String[]),
